      "source": "Load tracks asynchronously using [`loadTracks(withMediaCharacteristic:completionHandler:)`](avmutablemovie/loadtracks(withmediacharacteristic:completionhandler:).md) instead.",
      "ko": "대신 [`loadTracks(withMediaCharacteristic:completionHandler:)`](avmutablemovie/loadtracks(withmediacharacteristic:completionhandler:).md)를 사용해 트랙을 비동기적으로 로드합니다.",
